{"title":"역광","artist":"이자와 이치요","sourceId":"reference:UF0toMBWlsUfOzpqqsjy","sourceHash":"02119ff309b79aeeaebe9e993775f66099ef1368cf5d26a585b465dc3ddeb270","performanceStatus":"reference_timing","timingMethod":"reference_lrc_unverified","reviewStatus":"draft","cue_timing_confirmed":false,"timingWarning":"(주의) 노래와 함께 타이밍 검증되지 않았음","referenceProvider":"LRCLIB","referenceId":3912359,"cues":[{"id":"1","start":27.21,"end":33.45,"text":"散々な思い出は悲しみを穿つほど","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"2","start":33.45,"end":38.74,"text":"やるせない恨みはアイツのために","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"3","start":38.74,"end":40.49,"text":"置いてきたのさ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"4","start":40.49,"end":41.95,"text":"あんたらわかっちゃないだろ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"5","start":41.95,"end":43.59,"text":"本当に傷む孤独を","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"6","start":43.59,"end":46.22,"text":"今だけ箍外してきて","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"7","start":46.22,"end":52.98,"text":"怒りよ今 悪党ぶっ飛ばして そりゃあ愛ある罰だ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"8","start":52.98,"end":56.13,"text":"もう眠くはないや ないや ないや","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"9","start":56.13,"end":59.48,"text":"もう悲しくないさ ないさ そう","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"10","start":59.48,"end":66.15,"text":"怒りよ今 悪党蹴り飛ばして そりゃあ愛への罰だ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"11","start":66.15,"end":69.33,"text":"もう眠くはないな ないな ないな","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"12","start":69.33,"end":71.97,"text":"もう寂しくないさ ないさ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"13","start":71.97,"end":73.47,"text":"逆光よ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"14","start":73.47,"end":76.95,"text":"（なななななななな）","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"15","start":76.95,"end":80.26,"text":"（なななななななな）","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"16","start":80.26,"end":83.16,"text":"（なななななななな）","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"17","start":83.16,"end":86.85,"text":"（なななななな）","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"18","start":86.85,"end":93.16,"text":"惨憺たる結末は美しさを纏うほど","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"19","start":93.16,"end":96.02000000000001,"text":"限りなく 体温に近い","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"20","start":96.02000000000001,"end":99.99000000000001,"text":"「赤」に彩られていた","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"21","start":99.99000000000001,"end":106.43,"text":"散漫な視界でも美しさがわかるほど","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"22","start":106.43,"end":109.25,"text":"焼き付ける光を背に受ける","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"23","start":109.25,"end":113.84,"text":"「赤」に気を取られている","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"24","start":113.84,"end":117.58,"text":"もつれてしまった心は","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"25","start":117.58,"end":120.53,"text":"解っている今でも","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"26","start":120.53,"end":122.22,"text":"ほつれてしまった","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"27","start":122.22,"end":125.64,"text":"言葉が焦っている","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"28","start":125.64,"end":132.41,"text":"怒りよ今 悪党ぶっ飛ばして そりゃあ愛ある罰だ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"29","start":132.41,"end":135.69,"text":"もう眠くはないや ないや ないや","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"30","start":135.69,"end":138.97,"text":"もう悲しくないさ ないさ そう","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"31","start":138.97,"end":145.62,"text":"怒りよ今 悪党蹴り飛ばして そりゃあ愛への罰だ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"32","start":145.62,"end":148.82999999999998,"text":"もう眠くはないな ないなないな","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"33","start":148.82999999999998,"end":151.52,"text":"もう寂しくないさ ないさ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"34","start":151.52,"end":157.81,"text":"逆光よ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"35","start":165.81,"end":169.79,"text":"もう 怒り願った言葉は","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"36","start":169.79,"end":172.41,"text":"崩れ へたってしまったが","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"37","start":172.41,"end":178.63,"text":"今でも未練たらしくしている","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"38","start":178.63,"end":183.17,"text":"あぁ 何度も放った言葉が","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"39","start":183.17,"end":185.65,"text":"届き 解っているのなら","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"40","start":185.65,"end":192.72,"text":"なんて 夢見が苦しいから","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"41","start":192.72,"end":200.12,"text":"もう怒りよまた 悪党ぶっ飛ばして そりゃあ愛ある罰だ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"42","start":200.12,"end":203.48,"text":"もう眠くはないや ないやないや","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"43","start":203.48,"end":206.89,"text":"もう悲しくないさ ないさ そう","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"44","start":206.89,"end":213.4,"text":"怒りよさぁ 悪党ふっ飛ばして そりゃあ愛への罰だ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"45","start":213.4,"end":216.73,"text":"もう眠くはないな ないなないな","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"46","start":216.73,"end":219.46,"text":"もう寂しくないさ ないさ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"47","start":219.46,"end":220.96,"text":"逆光よ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"48","start":220.96,"end":224.19,"text":"（なななななななな）","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"49","start":224.19,"end":227.42000000000002,"text":"（なななななななな）","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"50","start":227.42000000000002,"end":230.38,"text":"（なななななななな）","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"51","start":230.38,"end":233.88,"text":"（なななななな）","translation":"","kind":"lyric"}],"candidates":[]}